      <ul><li><a href="https://www.goodnewsnetwork.org/teens-set-world-record-for-most-sports-balls-recycled-in-one-day-diverting-2675-pounds-from-landfills/" rel="noopener">Good News Network</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
