       <h1>'Competition Between US, China Should Be A Healthy One': Trump Tells Xi | Discuss AI Development</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#world news</span> <span>#US-China relations</span> <span>#diplomacy</span> <span>#trade</span></div>
       <p>President Donald Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping commenced formal discussions at the White House on Thursday, marking a significant diplomatic engagement between the two global powers. The talks were set to address a range of contentious issues, including trade relations, the status of Taiwan, and the burgeoning field of artificial intelligence development.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-24/competition-between-us-china-should-be-a-healthy-one-trump-t.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>In his opening remarks, President Trump characterized his relationship with President Xi as a &quot;truly great friendship.&quot; He emphasized that this bond had been forged since his first election in 2016, asserting it was built upon mutual respect and the vital interests of both nations' populations. These statements were made before aides from both delegations.</p><p>The leaders' meeting aimed to navigate complex geopolitical and economic challenges. The discussion points underscore the multifaceted nature of the relationship between the United States and China, which encompasses both areas of cooperation and significant points of divergence. The emphasis on a personal friendship by President Trump highlights an attempt to foster a constructive environment for these high-stakes negotiations.</p><p>What to watch: The specific outcomes or agreements reached on key issues like trade and AI.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately reports the details of the meeting as described in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/videos/world/competition-between-us-china-should-be-a-healthy-one-trump-tells-xi-discuss-ai-development-10351575.html" rel="noopener">News18 World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
