      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNSjZYRmVlRjNlcEwxWFhfVFg3bDhsaVA5OWxldmJlN3I3a2xPN2ZUTVM4ZC1Pdk1JU2Vtc29EM3htOXd4T19ZZmZtWUQ5TmY3b2JnVDdvZUw3S1lBVGp2MWJSWVJ6NF9KME5OX3dmZzdoYnBYa3VVbEU3d3FDdktTNTJRR2drZlY3anhKbjJ5UlZuaHl0Nkx3ZDJ0YWxDZDlzZ3hwVi1jSE80cUktX3NV?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
