       <h1>Men's Asian Games 2026: Match 4, AFG vs NEP Match Prediction – Who will win today’s match between Afghanistan vs Nepal?</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#Asian Games</span> <span>#Afghanistan</span> <span>#Nepal</span></div>
       <p>Cricket enthusiasts are gearing up for the fourth match of the Men's Asian Games 2026, where Afghanistan is set to compete against Nepal. The highly anticipated encounter will take place at the Korogi Sports Park, located in Nisshin, adding an international flair to the multi-sport event.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-24/mens-asian-games-2026-match-4-afg-vs-nep-match-prediction-wh.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This specific fixture, designated as Match No. 4, is scheduled for Friday, September 25. Both teams will be looking to make a strong impression early in the tournament, setting the stage for what promises to be a competitive contest. The Asian Games provide a significant platform for cricketing nations in the region to showcase their talent and vie for medals.</p><p>The Korogi Sports Park is expected to host a thrilling display of cricket as Afghanistan and Nepal battle it out. While specific team compositions and forms remain to be seen, the match is an important step for both sides in their Asian Games campaign, offering crucial points and momentum for the remainder of the competition.</p><p>What to watch: The performance of key players from both Afghanistan and Nepal as they aim for victory.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately captures the details provided in the source summary.</p>
