       <h1>Rashmika Mandanna Commands Attention at Milan Fashion Week, Fronting Onitsuka Tiger</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Fashion</span> <span>#Celebrity</span> <span>#Rashmika Mandanna</span> <span>#Milan Fashion Week</span></div>
       <p>Actress Rashmika Mandanna recently made a notable international appearance, adding another significant achievement to her career at Milan Fashion Week. Mandanna took to the runway as the face of Onitsuka Tiger’s much-anticipated 2027 collection, marking her presence on the global fashion stage.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-24/rashmika-mandanna-commands-attention-at-milan-fashion-week-f.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Her participation at the high-profile event drew considerable attention. Known for her versatility on screen, the actress was lauded for her distinct poise and personal style throughout the show, according to Bollywood Hungama. This engagement further elevates her growing international profile beyond her established acting career.</p><p>Mandanna shared the spotlight with a roster of global celebrities, amplifying the event's reach. Among the notable personalities present were Momo from the popular K-pop group TWICE, Japanese actor and singer Tomohisa Yamashita, Thai actress Baifern, and Thai actor Gulf. Their collective presence underscored the international appeal of the fashion week.</p><p>Her role as the face of the 2027 collection for Onitsuka Tiger signifies a strategic collaboration, placing her at the forefront of future fashion trends.</p><p>What to watch: Mandanna's future collaborations with international brands.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article correctly synthesizes the details provided in the source regarding Mandanna's appearance and the other celebrities present.</p>
