      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqe8ek7608mlo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" rel="noopener">BBC World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
